    "tool-carrier": "The same command carried by a different Claude Code tool (Monitor, PowerShell) than Bash must get the verdict Bash gives it.",
    "option-spelling": "An option of a command that discards uncommitted work written as an abbreviation, a cluster, a negated form or an alias, or left to run time."
